---
import Charts from './Charts.astro';

const files = [
  { name: 'energy.xvg', kind: 'xvg' },
  { name: 'data.json', kind: 'json' },
  { name: 'in.lammps', kind: '' },
  { name: 'license.json', kind: '' },
  { name: 'mask3d.tdr', kind: 'tdr' },
  { name: 'nmos.plt', kind: '' },
  { name: 'water.pdb', kind: 'pdb' },
];
const lines = [
  '@ title "Potential Energy"',
  '@ xaxis label "Time (ps)"',
  '@ yaxis label "Potential (kJ/mol)"',
  '@TYPE xy',
  '0.0   -12480.2',
  '0.2   -12510.8',
  '0.4   -12495.1',
  '0.6   -12530.4',
  '0.8   -12522.7',
  '1.0   -12548.0',
];
---

<section class="page page-stage" id="product">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stage-copy">
      <p class="kicker">操作</p>
      <h2>所见即所得，点击即预览。</h2>
      <p>点开文件，曲线、结构和场就出现在旁边。</p>
    </div>
    <p class="op-line" aria-live="polite">
      <span>转一下，工作台出现</span>
      <span>打开 showcase 目录</span>
      <span>点开 energy.xvg</span>
      <span>切到分屏</span>
      <span>曲线画在编辑器旁边</span>
      <span>点开 data.json</span>
      <span>点开 mask3d.tdr</span>
      <span>点开 water.pdb</span>
    </p>
    <div class="replay" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="spin-mask"><i class="spin"></i></div>
      <header class="rp-bar piece d1">
        <strong>工作台</strong>
        <span class="rp-grow"></span>
        <span class="rp-user">root</span>
        <span class="rp-btn">AI 助手</span>
        <span class="rp-btn">退出</span>
      </header>
      <div class="rp-body">
        <aside class="rp-tree piece d2">
          <div class="rp-path">/tmp/iminlab-showcase</div>
          <div class="rp-tools"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>打开</b></div>
          {files.map((file, i) => (
            <div class:list={['rp-file', file.kind && `rp-file-${file.kind}`, { on: file.kind === 'xvg' }]} style={`--i:${i}`}>
              {file.name}
            </div>
          ))}
        </aside>
        <div class="rp-main">
          <div class="rp-tabs piece d3">
            <span class="rp-tab-slot">
              <span class="rp-tab rp-tab-xvg">energy.xvg</span>
              <span class="rp-tab rp-tab-json">data.json</span>
              <span class="rp-tab rp-tab-tdr">mask3d.tdr</span>
              <span class="rp-tab rp-tab-pdb">water.pdb</span>
            </span>
            <span class="rp-seg"><b>文本</b><b>曲线</b><b class="split">分屏</b></span>
            <span class="rp-btn save">保存</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rp-stage">
            <div class="rp-scene xvg">
              <div class="rp-split">
                <div class="rp-editor">
                  <div class="rp-gutter">
                    {lines.map((_, i) => <span style={`--i:${i}`}>{i + 1}</span>)}
                  </div>
                  <div class="rp-code">
                    {lines.map((line, i) => (
                      <span class:list={[{ c: line.startsWith('@') }]} style={`--i:${i}`}>{line}</span>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="rp-view">
                  <div class="rp-plot">
                    <span class="rp-axis y">Potential (kJ/mol)</span>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="rp-chart">
                      <g stroke="#f0f0f0" stroke-width="1" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke">
                        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="100" />
                        <line x1="0" y1="100" x2="100" y2="100" />
                        <line x1="0" y1="25" x2="100" y2="25" />
                        <line x1="0" y1="50" x2="100" y2="50" />
                        <line x1="0" y1="75" x2="100" y2="75" />
                        <line x1="20" y1="0" x2="20" y2="100" />
                        <line x1="40" y1="0" x2="40" y2="100" />
                        <line x1="60" y1="0" x2="60" y2="100" />
                        <line x1="80" y1="0" x2="80" y2="100" />
                      </g>
                      <polyline
                        class="rp-stroke"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="#1677ff"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"
                        points="0,12 20,48 40,33 60,71 80,62 100,92"
                      />
                    </svg>
                    <span class="rp-axis x">Time (ps)</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="rp-stats">
                    <span>均值 -12514.5</span>
                    <span>标准差 22.39</span>
                    <span>最小 -12548</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rp-scene json">
              <div class="rp-split">
                <pre class="rp-plain"><span>{"{"}</span>
<span>  "name": "showcase",</span>
<span>  "temp": 300,</span>
<span>  "steps": 5000</span>
<span>{"}"}</span></pre>
                <div class="rp-view">
                  <div class="rp-card">
                    <b>showcase</b>
                    <span>temp · 300</span>
                    <span>steps · 5000</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rp-scene tdr">
              <div class="rp-split">
                <pre class="rp-plain"><span>mask3d.tdr</span>
<span>geometry   3D</span>
<span>regions    4</span>
<span>field      potential</span></pre>
                <div class="rp-view">
                  <div class="rp-chart-host"><Charts kind="field" /></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rp-scene pdb">
              <div class="rp-split">
                <pre class="rp-plain"><span>HEADER    WATER</span>
<span>COMPND    MOLECULE: WATER;</span>
<span>ATOM      1  O   HOH A   1</span>
<span>ATOM      2  H1  HOH A   1</span>
<span>ATOM      3  H2  HOH A   1</span></pre>
                <div class="rp-view">
                  <div class="rp-chart-host"><Charts kind="atoms" /></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="rp-rail piece d4">
          <h3>普通后台</h3>
          <p>以当前用户拉起一个进程。</p>
          <label>命令</label>
          <div class="rp-box">echo hello && sleep 2</div>
          <label>工作目录</label>
          <div class="rp-box">/tmp/iminlab-showcase</div>
          <span class="rp-btn save">运行</span>
          <p class="rp-empty">暂无数据</p>
        </aside>
        <i class="rp-cursor"></i>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
